[{"question": "What are the top 3 events by count yesterday?", "response": "### Summary\nThe top three events yesterday were primarily driven by core gameplay activity and monetization, with **Match_Started** being the most frequent event recorded.\n\n### Key Trends\n*   **Match_Started** led the count with **3,045,947** events.\n*   **Match_Ended** was the second most common, totaling **2,539,910** events.\n*   **Ad_Watched** completed the top three with **1,057,085** events.\n\nThe high volume of match-related events indicates strong player engagement, while the significant number of ad watches highlights active monetization within the game.\n\n```json-metadata\n{\n  \"query_details\": {\n    \"explore\": \"events\",\n    \"fields\": [\n      \"events.event_name\",\n      \"events.count\"\n    ],\n    \"filters\": {\n      \"events.event_date\": \"yesterday\"\n    },\n    \"limit\": \"3\",\n    \"model\": \"gaming\",\n    \"sorts\": [\n      \"events.count desc\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"sql\": \"SELECT\\n    events.event_name AS \\\"events.event_name\\\",\\n    COUNT(*) AS \\\"events.count\\\"\\n  FROM\\n    gaming.events AS events\\n  WHERE\\n    events.event  = '2026-08-12'\\n  GROUP BY 1\\nORDER BY 2 DESC\\nLIMIT 3\"\n}\n```\n", "embedding": [0.06525161862373352, 0.022534498944878578, -0.0016044757794588804, -0.03209744021296501, 0.03357855975627899, 0.07464413344860077, 0.010057397186756134, 0.0029989120084792376, 0.03203454241156578, 0.0018539945594966412, -0.012162287719547749, 0.022230403497815132, 0.026579981669783592, 0.014384647831320763, -0.03303724527359009, -0.031107736751437187, 0.015035586431622505, -0.013797841966152191, -0.05713466554880142, -0.02004198543727398, -0.035820282995700836, -0.023943021893501282, -0.000938416866119951, 0.012892961502075195, -0.006845579948276281, -0.051948245614767075, -0.022437872365117073, 0.05322021618485451, -0.03728572279214859, 0.003828598652034998, -0.03091379627585411, -0.01094905100762844, 0.0175248421728611, 0.0018